In the latest patch of Square City Builder, we've expanded language support, adding 16 new options! 
This update enhances accessibility for our global community, 
allowing even more players to enjoy the game in their preferred language. 
We're excited to continue improving the player experience and can't wait to hear your feedback. 
Thank you for your ongoing support!

